should be excluded from all agricultural land.","Reintroduction has no measurable effect on rivers.","Beaver dams increase downstream flooding in every case.","Beaver dams restore wetland hydrology and can reduce flood peaks at low cost."],"correctIndex":3},"highlightPrompt":"Highlight the sentence that carries the key claim described in the question.","sentenceOptions":["The beaver is therefore less a romantic symbol than a cheap piece of water infrastructure.","A mature canopy intercepts rainfall before it reaches the pavement, which reduces the volume of water that storm drains must carry during heavy storms.","The effect is selective: emotionally charged material and skills practised the previous day benefit most.","The pattern repeated: private credit came first, public currency followed, and inflation punished the issuers who ignored the difference between a promise and a reserve."]}',
